---

<Layout
  title="Blog | tuhr.es"
  description="Artículos prácticos sobre derecho laboral en España: finiquito, permisos, baja médica, vacaciones y más. Información actualizada 2026."
>
  <main class="pt-16">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <div class="max-w-[72rem] mx-auto px-gutter-desktop py-space-md">
      <nav class="text-body-sm text-on-surface/50">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors no-underline">Inicio</a>
        <span class="mx-space-sm">›</span>
        <span class="text-on-surface">Blog</span>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="max-w-[72rem] mx-auto px-gutter-desktop pb-space-2xl">
      <h1 class="font-headline text-headline-xl font-extrabold text-on-surface">Blog</h1>
      <p class="mt-space-md text-body-lg text-on-surface/60 max-w-2xl">
        Artículos prácticos sobre tus derechos laborales. Información actualizada, sin jaleo legal.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Articles Grid -->
    <div class="max-w-[72rem] mx-auto px-gutter-desktop pb-space-3xl">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-space-lg">
        {articles.map((article) => (
          <a
            href={`/blog/${article.slug}/`}
            class="group block bg-surface rounded-xl border border-outline/10 p-space-lg hover:border-primary/30 transition-all no-underline"
          >
            <span class="inline-block text-xs font-semibold text-primary bg-primary/10 px-space-sm py-space-xs rounded-full mb-space-md">
              {article.category}
            </span>
            <h2 class="font-headline text-headline-sm font-bold text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-space-sm">
              {article.title}
            </h2>
            <p class="text-body-sm text-on-surface/60 mb-space-md line-clamp-3">
              {article.description}
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-space-md text-xs text-on-surface/40">
              <span>{article.readTime} de lectura</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
